content.text:
The fault is in ts-admin-user-service: its `getAllUsers` method became slow with no resource saturation and no downstream cause. The effect reaches the user-facing ui-dashboard, so this is a single root cause.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-admin-user-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms, avg(duration/1e6) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND span_name='AdminUserController.getAllUsers' GROUP BY 1,2 UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', span_name, count(*), approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95), avg(duration/1e6) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND span_name='AdminUserController.getAllUsers' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "getAllUsers self-time p95 rose from about 8 ms in normal to about 1,654 ms in the incident period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT s.service_name, s.span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(s.duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.95) client_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.trace_id=c.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Downstream ts-user-service calls from admin-user still return in about 10 ms, so the delay is local to the method."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, metric, avg(value) v, max(value) mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','container.memory.working_set','container.memory.page_faults') GROUP BY 1,2 UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', metric, avg(value), max(value) FROM normal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','container.memory.working_set','container.memory.page_faults') GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 2,1",
          "claim": "Container CPU, memory and page faults stay flat or lower during the slowdown, so no resource saturation is visible."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-admin-user-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, p.service_name, p.span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(p.duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-admin-user-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's client calls to admin-user GET /users take about 1,660 ms p95, while the admin-user server span shows the same delay."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

